areaTest is test
areaTest purpose "Check `rectangle` on a 7 by 3 rectangle"
areaTest verifies rectangle widthTimesHeight
areaTest typeParameter none
areaTest input none
areaTest output none
areaTest outputOwnedBy none
areaTest raises none
areaTest effect none
areaTest uses none
areaTest memoryHeap false
areaTest async false
areaTest maxRecursion none
areaTest label begin loopKind none
areaTest label begin within none
areaTest let seven Int64 7 immutable
areaTest let three Int64 3 immutable
areaTest let twentyOne Int64 21 immutable
areaTest at begin do makeBox
areaTest at begin do runTarget
areaTest at begin do expectValue
areaTest at begin return ok none

makeBox is call
makeBox in areaTest
makeBox invokes shapes.Rectangle.new
makeBox argument width Int64 seven copy
makeBox argument height Int64 three copy
makeBox result box shapes.Rectangle
makeBox ownedBy none
makeBox cleanedBy none
makeBox borrows none
makeBox catch none

runTarget is call
runTarget in areaTest
runTarget invokes rectangle
runTarget argument shape shapes.Rectangle box copy
runTarget result result Int64
runTarget ownedBy none
runTarget cleanedBy none
runTarget borrows none
runTarget catch none

expectValue is call
expectValue in areaTest
expectValue invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectValue argument expected Int64 twentyOne copy
expectValue argument actual Int64 result copy
expectValue result none
expectValue ownedBy none
expectValue cleanedBy none
